{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locked Together is a horror experience inspired by escape rooms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into four levels, each offering a unique mini-adventure with different environments, items, puzzles, and entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.poster.avif?t=1762169413\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.webm?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/bd700b5fa1cc24c388d7eae7ff492e17.mp4?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the challenge alone or with friends (1-4 players) in co-op. Solve the puzzles and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.poster.avif?t=1762169413\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.webm?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/3c33ed91c1c80f735f527cb5bc311fc4.mp4?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine and interact with items as you try to unravel the mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.poster.avif?t=1762169413\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.webm?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/extras/2ab2dfe69bcdbb74302e247da11d6b26.mp4?t=1762169413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to be part of the development process or or stay updated with the latest news, join the <strong>Discord</strong>. Every type of feedback is appreciated!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escape the arcade room","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507220/b43398a0ffb0785e46e37664ea41a46e8421f81b.jpg"},{"name":"Escape the slaughterhouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507220/d98d95fd5202ba670c3a3a62bb898cbf0ee981d7.jpg"},{"name":"Escape the witch's manor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507220/4e9e2a6e235c63b1fe3aee07b5bfc84c209e1050.jpg"},{"name":"Escape the mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3507220/59c349d2ae97801df8431aa672d6afb3b164916f.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1762169413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507220?t=1762169413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762169413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507220/d84c9617f32ee695e0f6d9ff182849656a11d80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762169413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mult